exports[`office copy is never silently dropped > a blank form still prints the office-copy page, with an explicit note 1`] = `"<div class="fof-sheet"><header class="fof-head"><img class="fof-logo" src="/src/assets/harelick-logo.png" alt="Harelick Dental Associates, LLC"/><div class="fof-head-meta"><div class="fof-meta-item"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"></path></svg><span class="fof-meta-key">Date</span><span class="fof-meta-value">7/24/2026</span></div><div class="fof-meta-item"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg><span class="fof-meta-key">Patient</span><span class="fof-meta-value">—</span></div></div></header><section class="fof-hero"><div class="fof-hero-treatment"><div class="fof-kicker">Your Treatment</div><div class="fof-treatment-text">—</div></div><div class="fof-hero-card"><div class="fof-kicker">Your Total Cost (Your Portion)</div><div class="fof-hero-amount">$0.00</div><div class="fof-hero-sub">This is your estimated cost for the treatment above.</div></div></section><section class="fof-cards"><div class="fof-card fof-breakdown"><div class="fof-card-title">Cost Breakdown</div><div class="fof-row"><span>Total (Estimated) Cost*</span><span>$0.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-row-total"><span>You Pay (Your Portion)</span><span>$0.00</span></div></div><div class="fof-card fof-callout"><div class="fof-callout-inner"><span class="fof-icon-bubble"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><div><div class="fof-card-title">Prepay Discount Terms**</div><p>The &quot;Prepay Discount&quot; on this Financial Options Form will be honored if the total amount is paid either at the time of scheduling or at least two weeks prior to the appointment. For appointments scheduled less than two weeks in advance, payment must be made at the time of scheduling to qualify for the discount.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="fof-options"><div class="fof-options-head">Choose Your Payment Option</div><div class="fof-options-row"><div class="fof-option"><div class="fof-option-title"><span class="fof-option-icon"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="11" fill="currentColor"></circle><g fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M15.3 8.6h-4.8a1.85 1.85 0 1 0 0 3.7h3a1.85 1.85 0 1 1 0 3.7H8.7"></path><path d="M12 6.2v11.6"></path></g></svg></span>Option 1 · Prepay in Full — Pay Today &amp; Save</div><div class="fof-option-body"><div class="fof-row"><span>Total Patient Portion</span><span>$0.00</span></div><div class="fof-row"><span>Prepay Discount**</span><span>−$0.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-row-total"><span>Total Due with Prepay</span><span>$0.00</span></div></div></div><div class="fof-or">or</div><div class="fof-option"><div class="fof-option-title"><span class="fof-option-icon"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="2.5" y="4.5" width="19" height="17" rx="3" fill="currentColor"></rect><g fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M8 2.5v4M16 2.5v4M2.5 10h19"></path></g></svg></span>Option 2 · Payment Installment Agreement</div><div class="fof-option-body"><div class="fof-row fof-leaders"><span>Visit 1 (Upon scheduling)</span><span class="fof-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>$0.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-leaders"><span>Visit 2 (Prep date)</span><span class="fof-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>$0.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-leaders"><span>Visit 3 (On delivery)</span><span class="fof-dots" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>$0.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-row-total"><span>Total Due</span><span>$0.00</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="fof-band fof-band-split"><div class="fof-band-cell"><span class="fof-icon-bubble"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg></span><div><div class="fof-band-title">Financing Options Available</div><p>We offer outside financing through trusted providers. Call us at (508) 993-0515 to learn more — or with any questions about this form.</p></div></div></section><div class="fof-footnotes"><span class="fof-info-badge"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="currentColor"></circle><path d="M12 16.2v-5M12 7.8h.01" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span><div class="fof-footnotes-list"><p>* The &quot;Total Charges&quot; on this Financial Options Form will remain valid and honored for 60 days from the date listed above.</p></div></div><div class="fof-signatures"><p class="fof-sig-ack"><span class="fof-sig-ack-blank"><span class="fof-sig-ack-line"></span><span class="fof-sig-ack-caption">Patient&#x27;s Printed Name</span></span><span class="fof-sig-ack-text">has read this Financial Options Form in its entirety and agrees to the following plan:</span></p><div class="fof-choices"><div class="fof-choice"><span class="fof-checkbox"></span> Prepay in Full Agreement</div><div class="fof-choice"><span class="fof-checkbox"></span> Payment Installment Agreement</div></div><div class="fof-sig-row"><div class="fof-sig-field fof-sig-wide"><div class="fof-sig-line"></div><div class="fof-sig-caption">Patient Signature</div></div><div class="fof-sig-field"><div class="fof-sig-line"></div><div class="fof-sig-caption">Date</div></div></div><div class="fof-sig-row"><div class="fof-sig-field fof-sig-wide"><div class="fof-sig-line"></div><div class="fof-sig-caption">Harelick Dental Associates, LLC Representative</div></div><div class="fof-sig-field"><div class="fof-sig-line"></div><div class="fof-sig-caption">Date</div></div></div></div><footer class="fof-footer"><span class="fof-footer-item"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 10c0 4.99-5.54 10.19-7.4 11.79a1 1 0 0 1-1.2 0C9.54 20.19 4 14.99 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>278 Alden Road, Fairhaven, MA 02719</span><span class="fof-footer-item"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 .7 2.81 2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 0 0 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"></path></svg>(508) 993-0515</span><span class="fof-footer-item"><svg class="fof-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20M2 12h20"></path></svg>drharelick.com</span></footer></div><div class="fof-sheet fof-office-page"><div class="fof-office-head"><div><div class="fof-office-title">Office Copy — FOF Detail</div><div class="fof-office-sub">Patient: — · Date: 7/24/2026 · Template: Self-Pay<br/>Created by Megan Vincent on 7/24/2026 2:30 PM</div></div><div class="fof-office-stamp">Office Use Only</div></div><p class="fof-office-empty">No procedure lines were entered — this form printed blank. Record any handwritten codes and amounts on this page when filing.</p><div class="fof-office-summary"><div class="fof-office-col"><div class="fof-card-title">As Printed on the FOF</div><div class="fof-row"><span>Total (Estimated) Cost</span><span>$0.00</span></div><div class="fof-row fof-row-total"><span>Patient Portion</span><span>$0.00</span></div><div class="fof-row"><span>Prepay in Full (Prepay Discount)</span><span>$0.00</span></div></div><div class="fof-office-col"><div class="fof-card-title">Payment Schedule</div><div class="fof-row"><span>Visit 1 (Upon scheduling)</span><span>$0.00</span></div><div class="fof-row"><span>Visit 2 (Prep date)</span><span>$0.00</span></div><div class="fof-row"><span>Visit 3 (On delivery)</span><span>$0.00</span></div></div></div><p class="fof-office-note">File this page with the signed Financial Options Form. Internal record of the codes and amounts behind the patient-facing summary — not for distribution.</p></div>"`;
